ay, but a completed call is permanent. The three reserve guards already on the east concourse investigate LINK, not your unseen position. The lobby screen breaks sight; prepare the crew before calling, or clear a route with force. RADIO only prevents outside reinforcements."},{"title":"Keep the original","body":"Carry KEY into LIFT. If its carrier falls, recover it from that position; the call remains active. The lift stays available once it arrives. You choose when to board, and every survivor must be in the extraction ring. This operation ends at the tower, not back at the van."}]},"width":60,"height":42,"restricted":{"x":10,"y":4,"w":45.35,"h":32.35},"secure":{"x":14.4,"y":6.4,"w":11.2,"h":11.2},"gate":{"x":55,"y":28,"w":0.35,"h":5},"gateOutside":{"x":56.5,"y":30.5},"gateInsideOnly":true,"archive":{"door":{"x":20,"y":18,"w":3,"h":0.4},"inside":{"x":21.5,"y":16.8},"name":"dispatch office"},"response":{"spawns":[{"x":57,"y":29},{"x":57,"y":30},{"x":57,"y":31}],"patrol":[{"x":53,"y":30},{"x":40,"y":30},{"x":35,"y":23}],"specialists":[{"role":"sentry","posts":[{"x":51,"y":27},{"x":40,"y":30}]},{"role":"breacher","posts":[{"x":35,"y":23},{"x":28,"y":27}]}]},"solids":[{"id":"perimeter-north","x":10,"y":4,"w":33,"h":0.35,"height":1.8,"kind":"wall"},{"id":"perimeter-west-top","x":10,"y":4,"w":0.35,"h":19,"height":1.8,"kind":"wall"},{"id":"perimeter-west-foot","x":10,"y":32,"w":0.35,"h":4.35,"height":1.8,"kind":"wall"},{"id":"perimeter-south","x":10,"y":36,"w":45.35,"h":0.35,"height":1.8,"kind":"wall"},{"id":"perimeter-east-top","x":55,"y":6,"w":0.35,"h":22,"height":1.8,"kind":"wall"},{"id":"perimeter-east-foot","x":55,"y":33,"w":0.35,"h":3.35,"height":1.8,"kind":"wall"},{"id":"dispatch-north","x":14,"y":6,"w":12,"h":0.4,"height":1.8,"kind":"wall"},{"id":"dispatch-west","x":14,"y":6,"w":0.4,"h":12.4,"height":1.8,"kind":"wall"},{"id":"dispatch-east","x":25.6,"y":6,"w":0.4,"h":12.4,"height":1.8,"kind":"wall"},{"id":"dispatch-front-west","x":14,"y":18,"w":6,"h":0.4,"height":